# Netlify-format rewrites. Vercel ignores this file; vercel.json carries the
# same proxy rules. Both sides proxy /api/* and /socket.io/* to the backend so
# the session cookie is first-party on the Admin origin.
# Static-host rewrites do NOT proxy WebSockets; the Admin detects this and
# switches to Socket.IO polling, then RTK Query polling if needed.
/api/*        https://danxtech-portfolio-server.vercel.app/api/:splat        200
/socket.io/*  https://danxtech-portfolio-server.vercel.app/socket.io/:splat  200
/*            /index.html                                200
